{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/9357994bb4b216398c1d8b81cd90e5e4.webp?t=1769183890\" alt=\"Welcome to the Ministry\" width=616 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Dr Vincent Batten, who takes on his new role at the Ministry of Health of the Fourth Republic. Known as a care center for mentally unstable patients, you will find yourself curious, yet intimidated behind the walls of this facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In times when the republic is characterized by unrest and riots, it is all the more honourable to tackle such a task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family must be proud!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.poster.avif?t=1769183890\" aria-label=\"Peek into the entrance area of the Ministry of Health\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.webm?t=1769183890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.mp4?t=1769183890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A Doctor's Term</i> is a story-heavy walking sim featuring stunning environments,<br>thought-provoking narrative and an original soundtrack composed by Manolis Kalpenidis.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/d04784699ca6f88567cf1424bb1fd3d9.webp?t=1769183890\" alt=\"Lack of Opposition is Contribution\" width=616 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A confidential adventure where freedom of choice may be bigger than anticipated.<br>Observe your patients, test new samples on them, follow your orders! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the job?</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/13975e60a7aed674cf0f785fdce73f52.avif?t=1769183890\" alt=\"The Republic&#039;s crest with a Red Hand symbol on top\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Ministry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/9d4c2c40e4935c4d5ee577425f47e1e67cb01234.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Ceremonies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/b41033e89ca36dafb538f500543f932cfd08dc3f.jpg"},{"name":"Memoir of the Antecessor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/2f15af811e3985bc94ce6a11dfb4fec305bb807b.jpg"},{"name":"Shake Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/b29e002824efdab67a1551fb35a387dfca25bb07.jpg"},{"name":"Avoid the Limelight ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/cfabacce30b8491619f6559de729f13e1f62df46.jpg"},{"name":"Curious Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/cc37b3a5fcd891163415a80825d5e36bcb74c802.jpg"},{"name":"Good Doctor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050/05ae346d67ab37e1022a89e63b8bc9ed968dab47.jpg"},{"name":"Family Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2529050